cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mcmckit: lightweight Bayesian model updating with MCMC"
abstract: >-
  mcmckit provides a compact, dependency-light set of MCMC samplers for Bayesian
  model updating and inverse problems in engineering, with an emphasis on
  structural dynamics and structural health monitoring. It includes random-walk
  Metropolis-Hastings, MALA and adaptive MALA, RAM, DRAM, Metropolis-within-Gibbs
  and Transitional MCMC (TMCMC) with log-evidence estimation, together with
  utilities for modal likelihoods, noise estimation, hierarchical models,
  sequential updating, model comparison and convergence diagnostics.
type: software
authors:
